      },
      "pm:principalCorpus": "The Chaldean Oracles, transmitted in fragments through Proclus, Damascius and Psellos",
      "type": "pm:Tradition"
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "en": "The medieval and early modern Jewish transmission of the sefirot as the structure of emanation, and of the human act as bearing on it."
